}

delete {
  url: {{pim_base_url_v3}}/pim-product-lists/REPLACE_WITH_LIST_ID
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Confirmed live 2026-09-08 against a throwaway list (id
  `6aa032402b6fd055ffb7cabc`, since deleted) -- **not** either kept
  fixture. `openapi_pimv3.json` declares no `PATCH`/`DELETE` for this
  resource; both work anyway, same pattern confirmed on every resource
  tested so far this project:
  - `PATCH /pim-product-lists/{id}` with `{"name": "..."}` -- `200`,
    renamed successfully.
  - `DELETE /pim-product-lists/{id}` -- `204`, then `404` on a follow-up
    `GET`.
}
